# Copy to .env for local development.
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
#   Leave VITE_API_BASE_URL empty. The API client then uses same-origin
#   relative URLs (e.g. /api/auth/login) and the Vite dev server proxies
#   /api and /health to the backend (see vite.config.ts).
#   Equivalent explicit form: VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# PRODUCTION (Vercel frontend -> Render backend):
#   The Vite proxy does NOT exist in production. Set the full backend origin
#   in your Vercel project settings. The value is baked into the build:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://scoutiq-3pw1.onrender.com
#
VITE_API_BASE_URL=